# Memory update — fixed paths

Canonical list: `aileena-new/docs/MEMORY_WATCH_PATHS.md`

```
aileena-new/app/blog/**
aileena-new/app/updates/**
aileena-new/lib/research/**
aileena-new/lib/djSetlist.ts
aileena-new/public/dj-set/setlist.json
aileena-new/components/DJStation.tsx
```

## Auto

Merge to **`main`** touching any fixed path → Action **Memory on Article (fixed paths)**
(`.github/workflows/memory-on-article.yml`).

Do not ask the user to “start dreaming” after a normal article merge.

## Local

```bash
cd aileena-new && pnpm memory:on-article
```

## Do not

- Hand-edit `latest-content.md`
- Add ad-hoc path globs in chat — update `MEMORY_WATCH_PATHS.md` + `memory-on-article.yml` together
